<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Formal Resignation Letter</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background: #f1f3f5;
            font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
            color: #222;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .letter {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 70px 80px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border-top: 6px solid #1f3c5b;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #1f3c5b;
            font-size: 28px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .header .line {
            width: 70px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #c9a227;
            margin: 15px auto 0;
        }

        .date {
            text-align: right;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .recipient {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .recipient strong {
            color: #1f3c5b;
        }

        .subject {
            margin: 25px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1f3c5b;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .closing {
            margin-top: 35px;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 45px;
        }

        .signature-line {
            width: 240px;
            border-top: 1px solid #555;
            margin-top: 55px;
            padding-top: 8px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 55px;
            padding-top: 18px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                padding: 0;
            }

            .letter {
                max-width: none;
                box-shadow: none;
                border-top: none;
                padding: 50px 60px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .letter {
                padding: 40px 25px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="letter">

        <div class="header">
            <h1>Resignation Letter</h1>
            <div class="line"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="date">
            [Date]
        </div>

        <div class="recipient">
            <strong>[Manager's Name]</strong><br>
            [Position / Department]<br>
            [Company Name]<br>
            [Company Address]
        </div>

        <div class="subject">
            Subject: Formal Resignation from [Position]
        </div>

        <p>
            Dear [Mr./Ms. Last Name],
        </p>

        <p>
            Please accept this letter as my formal resignation from my position as
            <strong>[Position]</strong> at <strong>[Company Name]</strong>, effective
            <strong>[Last Working Day]</strong>, in accordance with the required notice period.
        </p>

        <p>
            I am sincerely grateful for the opportunity to have been part of the company.
            During my time here, I have gained valuable knowledge, skills, and professional
            experience that I will carry with me throughout my career. I also appreciate the
            support, guidance, and opportunities for growth that I have received from the
            management and my colleagues.
        </p>

        <p>
            This decision was carefully considered, and I believe it is the appropriate step
            for my professional and personal growth. I am committed to ensuring a smooth
            transition during my remaining time with the company and will do my best to
            complete my responsibilities and properly turn over any pending tasks.
        </p>

        <p>
            Thank you for the trust and support you have given me during my employment.
            I genuinely value the experience and relationships I have built here, and I wish
            the company and the entire team continued success in the future.
        </p>

        <p class="closing">
            Thank you for your understanding and consideration.
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
            Sincerely,

            <div class="signature-line">
                <strong>[Your Full Name]</strong><br>
                [Position]<br>
                [Employee ID, if applicable]
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            Formal Resignation Letter
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
